{"availability":"available","full":"praneethreddyganta/AutoStream-Agentic-AI","name":"AutoStream-Agentic-AI","description":"Agentic AI workflow automation platform using LangGraph, RAG, FAISS, and Gemini to intelligently automate multi-step tasks.","category":"Productivity","language":"Python","stars":13,"forks":2,"created":"2026-06-03T16:30:00Z","updated":"2026-06-07T17:15:15Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://autostream-agentic-ai.streamlit.app/","topics":["agentic-ai","faiss","faiss-vector-database","generative-ai","langgraph","rag","streamlit"],"demo":"https://autostream-agentic-ai.streamlit.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T15:47:06.899Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T15:47:06.899Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T15:47:06.899Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T15:47:06.899Z","stars":13,"forks":2}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Welcome to the AutoStream Agentic AI repository. This project is a production-grade, conversational sales and support agent built for the fictional SaaS company AutoStream (operating under the ServiceHive/Inflx platform).","The agent utilizes LangGraph state machines to orchestrate multi-turn slot-filling lead capture workflows, retrieves real-time pricing and features from a local FAISS Vector Database using Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG), and features a premium, responsive Streamlit user interface designed to replicate modern commercial AI products (like ChatGPT and Claude).","Unlike simple prompt-based chatbots, Agentic AI systems are autonomous entities that make decisions, determine execution routing, and call external APIs (tools) based on conversation state. This project models the conversational sales funnel as a state machine. It uses LangGraph to manage complex state transitions deterministically, ensuring that intent is classified accurately, information is collected progressively (slot-filling), and backend capture APIs are triggered only when all lead variables are satisfied."],"features":["LangGraph State Graph: Models the entire conversational flow as a state machine with persistent session checkpointer memory.","Gemini 2.5 Flash Integration: Powered by Google Gemini API for fast, reliable intent classification and natural response generation.","FAISS Vector Store RAG: Performs semantic search over local markdown documents using Google Text Embeddings for pricing and policy queries.","Structured Lead Slot-Filling: Dynamically tracks and extracts parameters progressively over multiple turns.","Mock CRM Integration: Automatically executes backend mock lead capture tools upon slot completion."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/praneethreddyganta/AutoStream-Agentic-AI/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"6600a5eff9f96875b1959c74c2e32312ed70f45ac59e123a6872b8ad6509b8e8","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T15:47:07.109Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T15:47:07.109Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Welcome to the AutoStream Agentic AI repository. This project is a production-grade, conversational sales and support agent built for the fictional SaaS company AutoStream (operating under the ServiceHive/Inflx platform).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/praneethreddyganta/AutoStream-Agentic-AI/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"Welcome to the AutoStream Agentic AI repository. This project is a production-grade, conversational sales and support agent built for the fictional SaaS company AutoStream (operating under the ServiceHive/Inflx platform).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/praneethreddyganta/AutoStream-Agentic-AI/blob/main/README.md"}],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Log in to Streamlit Community Cloud with your GitHub account.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/praneethreddyganta/AutoStream-Agentic-AI/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"6600a5eff9f96875b1959c74c2e32312ed70f45ac59e123a6872b8ad6509b8e8","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/praneethreddyganta/AutoS